1. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 0, or 42. Teacher checks method + units.
2. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 6, 0, or 19. Teacher checks method + units.
3. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 6, or 40. Teacher checks method + units.
4. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 6, 6, or 17. Teacher checks method + units.
5. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 5, or 38. Teacher checks method + units.
6. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 15, 5, or 15. Teacher checks method + units.

</details>

## Exit ticket

