5. Problem 5: Apply “Multiplying and Dividing Decimals” with quantities 12, 6, and 23 in a short story about a science fair supply run. Show work.
6. Problem 6: Apply “Multiplying and Dividing Decimals” with quantities 16, 8, and 46 in a short story about a Saturday soccer tournament. Show work.

