5. Problem 5: Apply “Common Order Mistakes” with quantities 7, 10, and 34 in a short story about a church youth group picnic. Show work.
6. Problem 6: Apply “Common Order Mistakes” with quantities 14, 10, and 11 in a short story about a library reading challenge. Show work.

