5. Problem 5: Apply “Equivalent Expressions” with quantities 12, 8, and 25 in a short story about a family road trip on I-20. Show work.
6. Problem 6: Apply “Equivalent Expressions” with quantities 12, 4, and 44 in a short story about a Saturday soccer tournament. Show work.

