4. Problem 4: Apply “Long-Passage Craft Synthesis” to this prompt about the mentor passage (or a 3–5 sentence extension you invent that stays consistent). Include evidence. Item code 13-0.
5. Problem 5: Apply “Long-Passage Craft Synthesis” to this prompt about the mentor passage (or a 3–5 sentence extension you invent that stays consistent). Include evidence. Item code 13-3.
6. Problem 6: Apply “Long-Passage Craft Synthesis” to this prompt about the mentor passage (or a 3–5 sentence extension you invent that stays consistent). Include evidence. Item code 8-5.

